{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/verifylogouttoken(_:configuration:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"verifyLogoutToken"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"token","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configuration","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OidcConfiguration","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OidcConfiguration"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"VerifiedLogoutToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK19VerifiedLogoutTokenV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the half that carries security weight: the input arrives unsolicited, from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"network, and instructs the RP to terminate a session. Every check below is required, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each exists because skipping it has a name:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Signature against the OP’s JWKS, through the same §12.4 verifier — no second"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key-fetching path."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"iss"},{"type":"text","text":" matches the discovery issuer; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aud"},{"type":"text","text":" contains this client’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"client_id"},{"type":"text","text":". A token"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"minted for another RP is not accepted here."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"events"},{"type":"text","text":" contains the back-channel logout key with an object value. This is what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distinguishes a logout token from an ID token; skipping it accepts a replayed ID token"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a logout instruction."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nonce"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"absent","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":". Back-Channel Logout 1.0 §2.4 forbids it, and its presence is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the documented signature of an ID token being replayed — rejected, not ignored."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"At least one of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sid"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sub"},{"text":" is present. A token naming neither identifies nothing.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"exp","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is in the future and ","type":"text"},{"code":"iat","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" recent.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken\/sid","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is present, end that session only.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" Falling back to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“every session for "},{"code":"sub","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"” when a "},{"code":"sid","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" was supplied is the same over-reach the server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses to make."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken\/jwtID","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" is surfaced so the caller can deduplicate; this SDK does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not dedup internally (§12.7.3 rule 7) — delivery is at-least-once, and a library with no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"durable store would silently drop a real second logout after a restart.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","title":"verifyLogoutToken(_:configuration:)","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"verifyLogoutToken"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"configuration"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"OidcConfiguration","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"VerifiedLogoutToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK19VerifiedLogoutTokenV"}],"extendedModule":"AxiamSDK","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC17verifyLogoutToken_13configurationAA08VerifiedeF